Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  别激动  没有必要怪谁  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Phoebe, calm down. There's no need to place blame. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.43,0:06:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我警告过她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I warned her about those candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能聊聊真好   居然这么久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's great to catch up. I can't believe how long it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   是不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler, is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.53,0:06:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  恭喜你  听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's great. Good for you. So, hey, hey, is it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们可以见个面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so, yeah, maybe we can get together, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你等我一下怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you hold on for one second, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你讲完   要不要叫彼萨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you're off the phone, you wanna get a pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   我回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来不错   好  就这么决定  好  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that sounds great. Okay, well, we'll do it then. Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候试镜  我知道是星期四  但是几点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, listen, so when's my audition? I know it's Thursday, but what time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嘿  我们没聊到那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. We didn't get to the audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我带她去喝咖啡时再说吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna take her to coffee and do it then. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你要跟这个女生约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, so now you're going on a date with this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是约会  我们失联10年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not a date. I haven't talked to her in 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总不能一通电话过去  就要人家帮忙吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't call somebody you haven't talked to in 10 years and ask for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要讲人情世故   花点时间客套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There are rules, you know? You gotta put in some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又不是去见旧情人  不  我们只约过一次会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not like you're going out with an ex. No, we only went out once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟她交往过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You dated her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一次也没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干脆我也去找个前男友  来帮乔伊的忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. Why don't I just go outwith an ex, you know, and do Joey a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想帮乔伊的忙   就跟乔伊约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you wanna do Joey a favor? Maybe you go out with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好   我朋友乔伊也在电影圈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. That's great. My friend Joey's in the movie business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.15,0:08:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜我那天遇见谁   豪伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm. You know who I ran into from school? Howie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友叫乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm. My friend's name is Joey. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然  豪伊在当剪接师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Apparently, Howie's editing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他打来问我能不能剪我的新片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, he calls me up and asks me if he can edit my new movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. Can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们10年没联络\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I haven't spoken to him in, what, 10 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他居然来找我帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he asks me for a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一向很讨厌那家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I've always hated that Howie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连声好都没问过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No "How you doing?" Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连先喝一杯咖啡都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I mean, not even a cup of coffee first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好大胆   就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. The nerve, huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,续杯吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Refill?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是等待已久的时刻   但是抱歉  房里一团乱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, this is last-minute, so I want to apologize for the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.65,0:08:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人介意啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.  Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.57,0:08:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我住的这儿的时候   绝对不是长这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It sure didn't look this way when I lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now look, There's only one problem, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能睡一个人  另一个人得去住乔伊家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's only room for one, so I guess one of you will have to stay at Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然火算是我放的   你就睡这里吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, since the fire was kind of my fault, I guess you should get to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey, hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁也没有错  菲比  那只是个意外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}this was no one's fault, Pheebs, okay? It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是我害的  你应该睡这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well no, It was my fault. You should get the nice room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋   你是摩妮卡饭店的首位贵客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Rach, you're the first guest at Hotel Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡饭店\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hotel Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得告诉我早餐想吃什么蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, you'll just have to tell me how you like your eggs in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打算端到床上给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought I'd bring them to you, you know, in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吃了这么多苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw. You've been through so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我放彼萨的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This right here is where I keep the pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里  放纸巾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's where the napkin is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么味道  就是啊  不清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's that smell? I know. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  那么大一个班   你根本没有注意到我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, please, it was such a big class. You never even noticed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊   当然有  你坐在昏昏欲睡的瞌睡虫旁边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Of course I did. You sat next to Sleepy Sleeperson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:10:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记不住全班的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. I had trouble remembering everyone's names...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就取绰号代替\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I came up with nicknames.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像你的另一边是   臭臭冯党卫队\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like the guy on the other side of you was Smelly von Brown-Shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我取过绰号没有   没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, um, did you have a nickname for me? Uh, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定有   是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, you did. What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可爱麦美眉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cutie McPretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  太可爱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好  说真的  今晚真的很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I gotta tell you, I'm having a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前说师生约会很奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how before you said it might be weird, the whole student-teacher thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也有同感   但结果不是这样   一点也不奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And to be frank, I thought it would be too. But it's not. I mean, it's not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒博士  伯特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dr. Geller. Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚睡得好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did you sleep well last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好   对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  摩妮卡太好了  在我枕头旁  放了一小片薄荷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did. Monica was so sweet. She left a little mint on my pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜乔伊在我枕头上放了什么   什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Know what Joey left on my pillow?  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:10:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,口香糖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到起火原因了  我知道  是我的蜡烛害的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we determined the cause of the fire. Yeah, I know. It was my candle, my candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  浴室有个电器没拔掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, there was an appliance left on in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是卷发器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It looks like a curling iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没用卷发器   那是总有人在用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't use a curling iron. Well, someone does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.58,0:11:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别看我  我的头发是直的  直的直的直的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, don't look at me! my hair's straight. Straight, straight, straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也可能是直发夹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It could've been a hair-straightener. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼萨都放这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is where I keep the pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纸巾呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And-Hey, where'd the napkin go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  可不能让贵客眼睛疲劳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go. I wouldn't want my best guest to strain her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕那个味道吗  什么  乔伊家的味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does that smell bother you? What, the smell from Joey's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不怕啊  这里又闻不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I can hardly smell it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闻得到就说  我可以烤个派把它盖过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you let me know if you can. Because I can bake a pie to cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点闻得到   烤个派吧  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can smell it a little. Bake the pie. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在  请稍候  火场调查员找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yes, one minute, please. It's for you. It's the fire inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  我是菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Hello? Yeah, this is Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.81,0:12:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  调查结果出来了  不是直发夹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, so it turns out that it wasn't the hair-straightener...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,引起的火灾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that started the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  是因为蜡烛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. It was the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,点燃蜡烛后不注意   实在太糟糕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It's very not good leaving candles unattended.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,消防学校最先教的事情之一就是这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, one of the first things they teach you in fire school is--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我该挂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, okay, well, I have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们玩得好开心  她好棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We had such a great time. She's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为年龄会成为问题   结果不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought the age difference might be a problem, but it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不会   就她的年纪来说   伊丽莎白非常成熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It wasn't at all. Elizabeth is very mature for her age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人就是不懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A concept lost on some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以师生可以约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it's okay to date a student?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  也不全是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,技术上讲呢   没触犯校规或什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, technically, it's not against the rules or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是会受到争议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it is frowned upon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是我们昨晚遇见的教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...especially by that professor we ran into last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,属于自以为是的学者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Judgy von Holier-Than-Thou.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  小心一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well Ross, you be careful now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别被叫成爱泡麦学生教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't wanna get a reputation as y'know Professor McNails-His-Students. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办   罗斯   这很清楚啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. What should I do? Well, Ross, it seems pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么更重要   别人的看法还是你的感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, what's more important, what people think or how you feel? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得忠于你的内心  乔伊   说得真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you gotta follow your heart. Joey, that is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿   你跟黛娜谈得怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, hey. So how'd it go with Dana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我星期四该不该腾出时间来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any reason I should leave a block of time open, say, Thursday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说不出口  你说不出口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't do it. You couldn't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别急  我需要更多的时间  我们晚上要吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Relax, I just need more time. We're going to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   你还要跟她出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You're going outwith her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟谁出去   大学的黛娜基史东\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Going out with who? Dana Keystone, from college.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   对   她不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Wasn't she, uh, mm...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   那是黛娜卡普林\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that was Dana Kaplan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   你根本不认识她   那又怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you didn't even know her. Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,故事真的好棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great story again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好错综复杂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The yarns that you weave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该走了  真的  我得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, uh, actually, I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不   留下来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no, stay, stay, because you should--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很受宠若惊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I am really flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是  我对你没那种感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I just... I don't feel that way about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  我不是  不是  钱德  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no. That's not-No, no, no. I'm sorry, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你人很好   我也不想伤害你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, you are such a sweet guy, and I don't wanna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我可以做点什么让你好过点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I wish there were something I could do to make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真是太伤心了  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it just hurts so bad, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:15:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你可以做一件事   什么事   你尽管说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe there is one thing you can do. What? Anything. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是刚刚才想到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I mean, this is just off the top of my head now. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.23,0:15:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个演员朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. But I have this friend, uh, this actor friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要是知道我这么做的话   一定会杀了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he would kill me if he knew that I was doing this, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以的话  能不能给他一次参加你的新电影试镜的机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but, um, would it be possible for him to get an audition for your movie...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如说  星期四\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...say, on Thursday?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我让你的朋友来试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you'd really feel better about me rejecting you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的能让你好过一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if your friend can audition for my movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的心愿   再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, the heart wants what it wants. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  怎么样啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这5分钟都没什么太大的变化\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, not much has changed in the last five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实有  我烤了饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it has. I made cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了   我还在消化你做的薯片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's all right. I'm still full from your homemade potato chips, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是饼干刚烤好   应该趁热吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. But you should eat them now because they're hot from the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  但不能在这里吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Oh. But not in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,床上不能吃饼干  记得吗  不能掉屑屑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't eat them in bed, remember? No crummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我马上出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be out in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么  门锁不起来  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? This doesn't lock, does it'?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  对不起  没关系  别担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Joey, sorry. Oh. Oh, it's all right, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你看   会留下污渍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, but look. Oh, that's gonna leave a stain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋   没关系   这是乔伊家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, hey, it's fine. You're at Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  当然  你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有这样吃过东西   我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never lived like this before. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   别浪费了  我是说它还能吃呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, well, don't waste it. I mean, it's still food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来要干嘛   要不要去喝杯酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you wanna do now, huh? You wanna go get a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦   我不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要念书   不是   我要满21岁才行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you have some studying to do? No, I have some turning 21 to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  呵呵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前念大学时  我们都经常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I remember when I was in college, we used to--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么  没事   我只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? Nothing, I'm just--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是觉得和你在一起很舒服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so comfortable with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕被别人看见吧   什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you not wanna be seen with me? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  当然不是  他们走了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, of course I do. Are they gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  他们还在  不过我想我该走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, they're still here. But I think I'm about to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  不  等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? No, no, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对   这样太蠢了  管别人怎么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right, this is stupid. Who cares what people think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们情投意合  对吧   这样并没有错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, we like each other, right? There's nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伯特  莉蒂亚  梅尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Burt. Lydia. Mel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.11,0:17:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是伊丽莎白  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is Elizabeth. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是在修我的流行文化课嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aren't you in my Popular Culture class?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.95,0:18:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错   莉蒂亚  伊丽莎白是学生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right, Lydia. Elizabeth here is a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we're dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以皱眉摇头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you may frown upon that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们不会再躲躲藏藏的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but we're not gonna hide it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定会被解雇的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are so fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   你会被解聘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? They're gonna fire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能和学生约会   这违反校规\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't date a student. It's against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  不只是受到争议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? It's not just frowned upon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Ah. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢住乔伊这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love it at Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮   谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. Thanks. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你星期四有事吗   真好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you busy Thursday? Oh, very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你记不记得   我试镜就是星期四\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know if you remember, but my audition was supposed to be Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你帮我争取到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got me the audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来来  我们抱一抱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Oh, let's hug it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你入选的话  打算对我做个什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you gonna do to me if you get the part?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:18:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay, I need to talk to you. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他们说直发夹是起火源\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I know that they said that the hair-straightener started the fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我也有责任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I think I'm partly at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看嘛   我没有告诉你   我最近刚刚换过厕纸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see, I didn't tell you, but, um, I had recently refilled the tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我们得正视这个问题   那个太容易着火了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And so, you know, let's face it, that's just kindling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我还是住乔伊家比较好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I think it's better that I stay at Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  菲比  都是我不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, Phoebe, this was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你知道吗   我在这里感觉太好了   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Besides, you know what? I'm fine here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   摩妮卡在找你   是嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Chandler, Monica's looking for you. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她好像说跟饼干屑有关   不会吧   我那么小心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, she said something about crummies. No, no, no. I was so careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你一定要跟我换  摩妮卡快把我逼疯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You have to switch with me. Monica is driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  小姐们都想住乔伊家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. All the ladies wanna stay at Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.39,0:19:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  菲比  少来啊  我不想换\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Phoebe, come on, I don't wanna switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托啦   我在这里可以扔湿纸巾玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please. Come on, I can throw wet paper towels here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是在摩妮卡那边   你只可能在水槽边吃饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, but at Monica's, you can eat cookies over the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个好像很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This looks like so much fun. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  湿答答的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, what a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,校规里真的有写啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, it actually is in the handbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能和你约会   或是在研究室用电磁炉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't date you or have a hot plate in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们居然不能再见面了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can't believe we have to stop seeing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管值不值得   谢谢你为我挺身而出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For what it's worth, I did appreciate you standing up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种感觉真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That felt really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我更喜欢你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of made me like you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我也很喜欢你  但是我们不能再继续交往了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know. I really like you too. But we can't date.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,校规明文禁止师生恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's against the rules. It's forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  光听你说校规 "禁止"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Just hearing you describe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就觉得好冲动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...as forbidden, it's really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管有多冲动   这都是错的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I don't care how hot it is, it's, uh-it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再说了   不  不  这是错的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop it. No, no. It's wrong. it's--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不太合适\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.27,0:21:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,禁忌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把书关上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不  再去弄个电磁炉吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Let's also get a hot plate. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啊  怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So? So...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是星期四   试镜结果如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Thursday. How was the audition? It's Thur--?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星期一  一天  星期二  二天   星期三三小  星期四\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monday, one day. Tuesday, two day. Wednesday, when, huh, what day? Thur--
